"ARC or PLC in Bladen County","/arc-plc/north-carolina/bladen-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Bladen County shows September to October under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, January to February came in at 59% of normal and May to June at 134%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 33% of normal on the middle. Grid 17308 had its driest year in 2007 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
